        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#4$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_486_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "I told you not to turn around. You let the mark get away."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_486_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz",
        "text": "I said, who the hell are you?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_486_1#9$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "Easy now, my dear Graf. Settle down."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_486_1#10$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "My official identity can be a bit messy to explain, so just treat me as a spy. I am called Biegler."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_486_1#10$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz",
        "text": "You... Why'd you have to jump out this exact moment? That man escaped because of YOU!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_486_1#9$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Biegler",
        "text": "Considering he ended up down in the sewers, it'll take him a long time to find another exit."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Biegler",
        "text": "Besides, you stopped him before he went into the sewer. Who knows, maybe the two of you saw that you were in a disadvantageous position and tried to put on a little show to try to fool me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_486_1#9$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz",
        "text": "You seriously think we're in cahoots? He and I?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_486_1#9$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Biegler",
        "text": "Or are you going to tell me that someone coerced you into going to see Gertrude? Spare me the bad jokes."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_486_1#9$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_486_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Biegler",
        "text": "You're worth much more than he is, Graf Urtica."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_486_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz",
        "text": "You can't stop me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_486_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Biegler",
        "text": "When it comes to combat ability, it is true that I can't stop you. But think carefully."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Biegler",
        "text": "This is a job straight from Their Majesties. Take a look."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_avg_paper1",
            "volume": 0.8
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1.2
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_486_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz",
        "text": "I've dealt with these things since I was six."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_486_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Biegler",
        "text": "I personally don't mind your snark, but you'd best show some self-restraint when it comes to Their Majesties' affairs."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_486_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz",
        "text": "Restraint? When you, a lowly spy, figure out that you've got the wrong person, you're going to be the one begging for forgiveness."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_486_1#2$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Biegler",
        "text": "You don't seem to understand the situation you're in, my good Graf Urtica."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_486_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Biegler",
        "text": "But enough of that. Don't try to stall for time here. Come with me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_486_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz",
        "text": "Where to?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_486_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Biegler",
        "text": "To where you belong. Don't worry, we've prepared detention facilities for suspects from all walks of life. I assure you, you'll enjoy the finest treatment."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_486_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz",
        "text": "Let me tell you something, Herr Biegler."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_486_1#9$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Biegler",
        "text": "Ready to beg for mercy? Or is it a bribe? In case of the latter, I'd be more than glad to oblige."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_486_1#9$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz",
        "text": "I doubt a little bit of money is enough for you to let me go. Why do I get the impression that you'd take me away regardless, even after you pocketed the money?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_486_1#10$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Biegler",
        "text": "Clever boy."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_486_1#10$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz",
        "text": "I find you rather easy to get along with, Herr Biegler. You remind me of the Urtica I know so well, where most of the people are just as 'upstanding' as you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_486_1#10$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Biegler",
        "text": "I am honored to hear that."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_486_1#10$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz",
        "text": "But what I really want to know is what that man is doing in the sewers."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_486_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Biegler",
        "text": "But you were the one who stopped him, right under my nose."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_486_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz",
        "text": "Well, this is a bit embarrassing to say, but I wanted to resolve things up here."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#5$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_486_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz",
        "text": "One of my agents liked to tell stories that would make you want to hurl. Of the ones that instantly killed your appetite for the day, the worst all came from the sewers."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#5$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_486_1#9$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Biegler",
        "text": "Ah. If your stomach is upset, perhaps we should go for a cup of coffee to smooth things over."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_486_1#9$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz",
        "text": "I'd love to, but I'd much rather find out what he's doing down there. I might as well go after him."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz",
        "text": "And this is all your fault, Herr Biegler."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz",
        "text": "As long as you let me head down, you can keep pointing your wand at me. I won't try to run."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_486_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Biegler",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Biegler",
        "text": "I will warn you in advance\u2014There will be consequences for running away from me without authorization, regardless of the reason."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_486_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz",
        "text": "What kind? Will you put me down?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_486_1#2$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Biegler",
        "text": "You'd at least be stripped of your status. Even if you're proven innocent in the future, you'd never be able to step into the Spire of Urtica ever again."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#11$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_486_1#2$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz",
        "text": "Don't threaten me with a good time. I might be even more inclined to try running now."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#11$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_486_1#2$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Biegler",
        "text": "(Shakes head)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#11$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_486_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Biegler",
        "text": "In any case, since you insist on heading down there... After you, Graf Urtica."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Biegler",
        "text": "I'll be keeping a close eye on you."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
