        }
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 2,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_489_1#2$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursula",
        "text": "Hibiscus, this isn't a lecture, but y'can't speak to Mein Herr that way."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_489_1#2$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus",
        "text": "But, Mr. Czerny is..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_489_1#2$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursula",
        "text": "There's lots of things he can't say, leavin' this old lady to say 'em."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_489_1#2$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus",
        "text": "Please come in."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_489_1#2$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursula",
        "text": "Do you know how the Afterglow got its name?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_489_1#2$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus",
        "text": "I don't."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_489_1#2$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursula",
        "text": "Mein Herr once said..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursula",
        "text": "'It is precisely because night falls, that the afterglow is even more precious. If the long veil of night were to never lift, what could be more dazzling and awe-inspiring than the warm afterglow?'"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_489_1#2$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus",
        "text": "It's a wonderful saying, but..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner",
        "text": "Oh, the two over there are\u2013\u2013 Frau Ursula, and Hibiscus?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_494_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner",
        "text": "Come, come! If you want to chat, do it over here!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_494_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner",
        "text": "Why the long face, Hibiscus? Did something happen?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_494_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner",
        "text": "If you're worried that my food isn't healthy enough, I also have sparkling water here. Come, come!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus",
        "text": "We're still\u2013\u2013"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_489_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursula",
        "text": "Let's oblige him this time."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner",
        "text": "Frau Ursula, what's wrong with Hibiscus? Did she get into an argument?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_489_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursula",
        "text": "No, none of that. Enough random guessing."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursula",
        "text": "I was telling Hibiscus about the history of the Afterglow."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner",
        "text": "The Afterglow's history? Now that's something I couldn't be more familiar with."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner",
        "text": "Not bragging either. But I bet I know even more than Frau Ursula here."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner",
        "text": "The Afterglow didn't used to be a residential area for the Infected. It was one of Vyseheim's industrial plates."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner",
        "text": "Don't underestimate me just because I'm setting up shop over here. Back in the day, I was in charge of feeding hundreds of associates."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1",
            "fadetime": 0.7
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 0.7
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus",
        "text": "Industry... Could it be that this place was turned into an Infected residential area because of the spread of Oripathy due to industrial waste?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_494_1#2$1",
            "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner",
        "text": "Industrialization did bring a lot of Infected here, but back in Leithanien's old days, there was no such thing as a ghetto for Infected... Hah, I won't keep rambling on."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner",
        "text": "One year, Vyseheim constructed a magnificent concert hall that shocked the world with but a single order from Him, His Majesty... known now as our Afterglow Hall. Back then, that's not what the concert hall was called."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus",
        "text": "His Majesty? Which one are you referring to?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_489_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursula",
        "text": "Oh dear, Hibiscus, let's not worry about the details, alright?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursula",
        "text": "If it's 'His' Majesty..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus",
        "text": "...I get it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner",
        "text": "When the concert hall was completed, 'He' still reigned, and nobody dared to say anything."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_494_1#2$1",
            "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner",
        "text": "But He left us just as quickly, and Graf Strollo, who took over Vyseheim, hated this concert hall."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_494_1#2$1",
            "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#9$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus",
        "text": "Maybe hate isn't the right word, but rather... was too quick to show loyalty?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_494_1#3$1",
            "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#9$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner",
        "text": "Shh\u2013\u2013 No random guessing."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_494_1#2$1",
            "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#9$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner",
        "text": "A few years later, the powers issued an order to supposedly improve the treatment of the Infected. The Graf at that time took the opportunity to lump the concert hall together with the industrial plate, and turned it all into the Infected ghetto."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner",
        "text": "I looked all over and before that, there were no such things as 'Infected quarters' anywhere in Leithanien."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_494_1#2$1",
            "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#9$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus",
        "text": "The Count, the Graf, at that time... Wasn't that the very same Dame Gertrude?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_494_1#2$1",
            "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#9$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner",
        "text": "It was either her father\u2013\u2013 or her oldest brother... I can't really remember, but it wasn't actually her."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner",
        "text": "Though the Graf at the time designated this area for the Infected, he didn't care whether the people in it lived or died. He even had all the industrial facilities torn down."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner",
        "text": "Obviously, to have us fend for ourselves."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner",
        "text": "So among the nobles, this place became known as 'the Afterglow,' and the concert hall also became the 'Afterglow Hall.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner",
        "text": "The name, 'Afterglow,' represented the idea that we wouldn't last long, just like the last rays of light in the evening."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_494_1#2$1",
            "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus",
        "text": "That... That's simply cruel and unusual."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_494_1#2$1",
            "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner",
        "text": "It was pretty over-the-top."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner",
        "text": "But for the Afterglow at the time, that word was a perfect fit."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner",
        "text": "Everyone fought desperately to survive, to let the lingering rays of sunlight on the horizon struggle for just a bit longer."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner",
        "text": "We set up stalls, we ran errands. Some of us even turned into hired thugs for rich people in the other plates... Hah, those were some chaotic years."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner",
        "text": "Later on, Herr Czerny stepped forward."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_494_1#2$1",
            "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus",
        "text": "Stepped forward?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_494_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner",
        "text": "He started out as a nobody."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner",
        "text": "He had written a few pieces, but since he was an Infected, everything was published anonymously."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner",
        "text": "His works were magnificent, even attracting attention from the fancy folk atop the spires. But once they saw that Herr Czerny was from the Afterglow, they quickly turned away and left."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner",
        "text": "That was until he wrote 'Morgen und Abend.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner",
        "text": "Ursula would be more qualified to speak about 'Morgen und Abend' than me, so I'll turn the floor over to her."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus",
        "text": "Ms. Ursula?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_489_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursula",
        "text": "Oh, it's actually quite simple."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursula",
        "text": "The one who taught piano to Mein Herr had a daughter, and she was good friends with him."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursula",
        "text": "The two were on very good terms, and they were just about as good as each other. They were awfully competitive, always trying to one-up the other."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_489_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursula",
        "text": "Sadly, the girl passed away when Mein Herr was twenty years old."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_489_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursula",
        "text": "Losing her was a huge blow to him. Day in n' day out, he spoke hardly a word. He grew thinner and thinner by the day."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursula",
        "text": "Until finally, he showed a stack of sheet music, told me it's his newest composition, and that he wasn't gonna publish anonymously this time."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursula",
        "text": "The Gr\u00e4fin then\u2013\u2013 she was the very same Dame you mentioned."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursula",
        "text": "Still don't know why, by the Gr\u00e4fin sought out Mein Herr."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursula",
        "text": "She became his sponsor, and also went 'long with all his ideas. She gave him her full backing, finally lettin' 'Morgen und Abend' carry the Czerny, and spread it all throughout the Afterglow."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus",
        "text": "I can't imagine that."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus",
        "text": "But I'm starting to understand a bit of what Mr. Czerny meant in his saying..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_489_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursula",
        "text": "'Morgen und Abend' was so popular and beloved, the folk in the spires couldn't blind eye anymore. They had no choice, they had to acknowledge Mein Herr's talent."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus",
        "text": "So then, Mr. Czerny began to cultivate people in the Afterglow who had musical talent?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_494_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner",
        "text": "That's right. Seeing as how we are in Leithanien, the one thing we aren't short on is musicians! I may not have any talent, but even I..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_489_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursula",
        "text": "Oh stop it, you're just being humble."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursula",
        "text": "A few years ago you were still playin' the accordion while yodelin' about your pickled cabbage."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_494_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Food Stall Owner",
        "text": "Haha, back in my factory days, I had to gather everyone up for lunch. Way easier to use an accordion than to shout."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_489_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursula",
        "text": "Anyway, once music became a part of the Afterglow, our worst days finally passed."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursula",
        "text": "Composin', performin', teachin', makin' instruments..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursula",
        "text": "Plenty of folk publish their compositions anonymously, and most performers can't leave the Afterglow. But still, the money it brought in gave the Afterglow a foot in the door."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_489_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursula",
        "text": "But before long, Mein Herr got into some big fight with the Gr\u00e4fin."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus",
        "text": "A big fight?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_489_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursula",
        "text": "Looked like a clash of ideas... not that understand such things."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursula",
        "text": "The Gr\u00e4fin stayed the Herr's patron, but the two have hardly made contact since."
    },
    {
